to support\n- Can now start and control the app without controllers\n- Add a clear button to PIN screen\n- Add some textual guidance on app usage\n\nImprovements\n- Significantly improve video sharpness on supported platforms\n- Slightly improve quality of default background\n- Reduce storage requirements when switching between accounts\n- Clarifications of certain texts in the app\n\nFixes\n- Fixes an issue where the license could become invalid when the device was connected to a wifi network without internet\n- Headset dismount actions now trigger properly\n- Fixes stereoscopic rendering for certain formats\n- Fixes slightly offset video center\n- Fixes wobbly video rendering in certain videos\n- Several fixes to content downloading\n- Fixes several storage permission issues\n- Security fixes\n- Support file extensions with capital letters\n- Fixes shimmering lines around text in settings menu", "created_date": 1761210406, "id": "25680780818176293", "version": "6.0.0", "version_code": 44, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4504066639607685", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "25680780818176293"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "310463370574711"}]}, "change_log": "Add some textual guidance on app usage, allow going back to pin screen for trial users, and fix a revoke license bug.", "created_date": 1740151130, "id": "9976836702330624", "version": "5.2", "version_code": 42, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isA